# TestNG's ServiceLoader registration point.
#
# Every listener named here is attached to every suite in this project automatically. That is the
# whole reason the file exists: a <listeners> block in a suite XML has to be copied into each new
# suite, and the first time someone forgets, that suite quietly runs without retries, without
# failure evidence and without Allure step detail - and still reports green.
#
# IAnnotationTransformer, ITestListener and ISuiteListener all extend ITestNGListener, so they
# share this one file.

com.adarsh.listeners.RetryTransformer
com.adarsh.listeners.TestListener
com.adarsh.listeners.BrowserParameterListener
